; GENERATED by tools/make_world.py - the coloured objects' colours. A block (8 bytes): the
; world x, y of its first row, the attribute, its height - 1, its first and last pixel from
; x. The list ends with 0xFFFF. (Rectangles only: an object with a shaped inside - the mug,
; an egg - needs a span for each row, which obj_paint had once: see the git history.)
obj_tab:
        dw 0xFFFF
